        "type": "text/plain",
        "value": "<h2>\r\n  \n                  \n  Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa Foundation\u00a0\n    \n    \n      2021\u00a0\n    \n    \n      Scholarships\u00a0\n    \n    \n      \u2013\n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n    \n      now open\n    \n    \n      !\n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n\n                \r\n</h2>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <b>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n                        \n      \n      \n        Supporting our people financially to be all they can\u00a0\n      \n    \n    \n                      \r\n      </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <b>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n                        \n      \n      \n        be\n      \n    \n    \n                      \r\n      </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      The Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      Foundation\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      General and A.R.T Scholarships are provided to encourage and support students to undertake higher level studies (Heke and above) at Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa in 2021.\u00a0\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      Students from any iwi may apply however, preference will be given to members of\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      A.R.T -\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      Te \u0100ti Awa\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      ki\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      Whakarongotai\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      , Ng\u0101ti Toa Rangatira and Ng\u0101ti Raukawa\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      ki\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0te Tonga.\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2>\r\n  \n                  \n  Eligibility\u00a0\n      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n\n                \r\n</h2>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      Open to\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      fulltime\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      or part time\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      students studying\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      over 0.5 study load\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0enrolled at\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      heke, poutuarongo, pout\u0101h\u016b and t\u0101huhu level in 2021,\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      with the exception of\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      :\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      All students needing financial assistance to study should apply, applications will be considered on a\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      case by case\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0basis.\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2>\r\n  \n                  \n  Value\n      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n\n                \r\n</h2>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      Amount to be determined\u00a0for full-time students\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      .\u00a0\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      Students studying over 0.5\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      part-time\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      receive an amount\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      respective to the\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      ir\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0study load.\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2>\r\n  \n                  \n  Closing Date\n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n\n                \r\n</h2>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      31\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      March 202\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      1\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      .\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0 All applicants will be notified of the outcome\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      mid April\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a02021\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0and upon confirmation of enrolment.\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2>\r\n  \n                  \n  Additional Information\n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n\n                \r\n</h2>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      Conditions\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2>\r\n  \n                  \n  \u00a0\n    \n    \n      Payment Advice\n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n\n                \r\n</h2>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      Payments will be applied to the 202\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      1\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0fees in two instalments (\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      mid year\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0and end of year). More information about payments will be provided in\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      the applicants\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u2019\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0success\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0letter.\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2>\r\n  \n                  \n  Apply Online\u00a0\n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n\n                \r\n</h2>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      Before completing the application ensure you have read and understand\u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      eligibility and criteria information.\u00a0 The following information is required when completing the application:\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    \n                    \u00a0To begin your application click on the button below.\n                  \r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <a href=\"https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=mj9VgXBXZE21EJLokEdC_RSxrS91gfJLjpMlv53mN1tURVA5NVpQT1dQUjdHTThMMTlOU1VOOVVXNy4u\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n      \n                      \n    \n  \n      Click here to Apply Online\n    \n\n  \n                    \r\n    </a>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    \n                    \u00a0\n                  \r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2>\r\n  \n                  \n  \u00a0\n    \n    \n      Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa Foundation\n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n\n                \r\n</h2>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      For more information on the Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa Foundation visit\u202f\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <a href=\"https://www.tworfoundation.co.nz\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n                        \n      \n      \n        www.tworfoundation.co.nz\n      \n    \n    \n                      \r\n      </span>\r\n    </a>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      .\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <b>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n                        \n      \n      \n        Kia rangatira te t\u016b a Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa, hei\u00a0\n      \n    \n    \n                      \r\n      </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <b>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n                        \n      \n      \n        whare\n      \n    \n    \n                      \r\n      </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <b>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n                        \n      \n      \n        \u00a0ako\u00a0\n      \n    \n    \n                      \r\n      </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <b>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n                        \n      \n      \n        whakatupu\n      \n    \n    \n                      \r\n      </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <b>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n                        \n      \n      \n        \u00a0\n      \n    \n    \n                      \r\n      </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <b>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n                        \n      \n      \n        hoki\n      \n    \n    \n                      \r\n      </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <b>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n                        \n      \n      \n        \u00a0\n      \n    \n    \n                      \r\n      </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <b>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n                        \n      \n      \n        i\n      \n    \n    \n                      \r\n      </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <b>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n                        \n      \n      \n        \u00a0te m\u0101tauranga.\n      \n    \n    \n                      \r\n      </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n                      \n    \n    \n      \u00a0\n    \n  \n  \n                    \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>"
      }
